      445        VIEW-AS FILL-IN
      446        SIZE 4 BY 1.
      447   DEFINE VARIABLE f-rest-sum-doc AS DECIMAL FORMAT "->,>>>,>>>,>>>,>>9.99" INITIAL 0
      448        LABEL "Осталось разнести"
